{"version":1,"key":"card:151","content":{"id":151,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过将 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"characterData","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"true","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来监听文本节点的变化。其相应的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"MutationRecord","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"type","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"characterData","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"const observer = new MutationObserver(mutations => {\n  mutations.forEach(mutation => {\n    console.log(mutation);\n  });\n});\n\nobserver.observe(container.firstChild, {\n  characterData: true\n});","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"61334f65-e3c9-4b74-8b06-daeefb57d823","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"注意点："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当使用 Ctrl + B 或者 Ctrl + I 使得文本加粗或者倾斜时，会使得原文本节点变为多个节点，这时你再编辑文字，会发现 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"MutationObserver","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不起作用，除非你编辑的文字被认为是原始的文本节点。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当你将文本节点包含的所有文字都删除后，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"MutationObserver","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不再触发回调函数，因为一旦文字删除后，原文本节点就被移除了，再次输入的文字形成了一个新的文本节点，而这个文本节点并没有被监听。如果以 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"childList: true","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 监听文本节点父容器，可以观察到删除所有文本的时候会触发一次回调函数，因为此时文本节点被删除了，而删完之后新增文字又会触发一次回调函数，因为此时新增了一个文本节点。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输入中文字符时 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"MutationObserver","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"无法监听到对应变化。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以上三个问题均可以通过配合 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"subtree","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来解决，当设置 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"subtree","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"true","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，可以监听到子节点中文本的变化，所以不管是分裂为多个节点还是原节点被删除然后新增，所有文本的变化都可以被检测到。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"const observer = new MutationObserver(mutations => {\n  mutations.forEach(mutation => {\n    console.log(mutation);\n  });\n});\n\nobserver.observe(container, {\n  characterData: true,\n  subtree: true\n});","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"d0247f74-aa2f-4705-9729-6529e8961f1b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"warning","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"选择文字然后进行删除，这个文本变化好像检查不到。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"设置 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"characterDataOldValue","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"true","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 后，可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"MutationRecord","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"oldValue","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性获得变动之前的文本。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"const observer = new MutationObserver(mutations => {\n  mutations.forEach(mutation => {\n    console.log(mutation.oldValue);\n  });\n});\n\nobserver.observe(container, {\n  characterData: true,\n  characterDataOldValue: true,\n  subtree: true,\n});","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"affd0a1c-0476-4a0f-ba66-e4053e1befac","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["DOM/Mutation Observer"],"createTime":1690161023721,"updateTime":1743303640405,"linkedCards":[{"id":148,"target":{"key":"card:148","type":"card","id":148},"summary":"在复杂的网页应用中，DOM 结构会频繁的发生变化，有的时候我们需要根据变化来进行相应的操作，以往通过 Mutation Events 来监听 DOM 的变化，目前它已经废弃了，被 MutationObserver 所取代。 Mutation...","tags":["DOM/Mutation Observer"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640405}}